  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Social Conscience Through Continuing Formation of Laity: Focus on Catholic Professionals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to create a safe space for catholic professionals to reflect, interact and debate with fellow Catholics on issues of concern in their countries. The project aims at the cultivation of a culture of political participation, civic debate and democratic engagement on issues of social transformation, transitional justice and reconciliation.

Objectives
-To expose catholic professionals in Eastern and Southern Africa to the Church&apos;s social teaching and deepen their commitment to social justice and social transformation.
-To encourage close collaboration on justice issues between catholic professionals, organisations and institutions in Eastern and Southern Africa and across the regions.</narrative>
  </description>
